<title>USA: Lear says completes Borealis acquisition.</title>
<headline>Lear says completes Borealis acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lear Corp said it completed its acquisition of Borealis Industrier AB from Borealis Holding AB for about $85 million.</p>
<p>Borealis had 1995 sales of about $230 million and has five plants in Sweden with 1,800 employees.</p>
<p>Lear said it is the world's largest independent supplier of automotive interior systems and had 1995 sales of $4.7 billion. It has 40,000 employees in more than 140 plants in 19 countries.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
